{"id":"226cc20b75e0d203","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-compactness-property.md","title":"Compactness of an Abstract Logic","display":"df-compactness-property — Compactness of an Abstract Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-compactness-property","aliases":["67-df-compactness-property"],"display":"df-compactness-property — Compactness of an Abstract Logic","depends_on":["[[67-df-abstract-logic]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-compactness-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-compactness-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compactness-property — Compactness of an Abstract Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e5558885fabd8e01\" href=\"?note=e5558885fabd8e01\" title=\"67-df-abstract-logic\">67-df-abstract-logic</a> 的候选逻辑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 为签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\{\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma:|\\Delta|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\">\\([\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}=\\{\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma:|\\Delta|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma,\\Gamma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n\\left[(\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma,\\Delta))\n\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma,\\Gamma)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma,\\Gamma)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n\\left[(\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma,\\Delta))\n\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma,\\Gamma)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条只给出后续条目实际使用的接口；所有数学条件均已列入前两节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是 [[67-df-abstract-logic]] 的候选逻辑；$\\sigma$ 为签名，$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}=\\{\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma:|\\Delta|<\\aleph_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma,\\Gamma)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Str}_\\sigma\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathcal L,\\sigma}\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma)\\\n\\left[(\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}\\ \\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma,\\Delta))\n\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(\\sigma,\\Gamma)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1453,"backlinks":[{"id":"9d5826a0b09d31cb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}$、$\\mathrm{LS}$ 分别取 [[67-df-compactness-property]]、[[67-df-lowenheim-skolem-property]]；$\\equiv\\mathrm{FO}$ 取 [[67-df-ab